; vbox JavaScriptCore import library export table (batch Q · Q-03, Windows JSC).
;
; Playwright's webkit-win64.zip ships JavaScriptCore.dll WITHOUT a .lib, so the
; import library must be rebuilt from the DLL's exported symbols. scripts/
; build-jsc-windows.ps1 feeds this file to MSVC lib.exe:
;     lib /def:JavaScriptCore.def /machine:x64 /out:JavaScriptCore.lib
;
; Only the 8 JSC C API symbols used by jsc/wrapper.c are listed. On x64 there is
; no name decoration, so these names match the DLL's exports exactly.
EXPORTS
    JSGlobalContextCreate
    JSGlobalContextRelease
    JSStringCreateWithUTF8CString
    JSStringGetMaximumUTF8CStringSize
    JSStringGetUTF8CString
    JSStringRelease
    JSEvaluateScript
    JSValueToStringCopy